  "diagnosis": "Committed AOT lock files already contain Linux RID and pinned11.0.0 compiler/linker metadata. Before the repair, plural-only RuntimeIdentifiers evaluation left NuGetLockFilePath empty in these three projects, so separate dotnet restore -r read the ordinary lock and failed NU1004. No lock regeneration was needed.",
  "selection_behavior": [
    "PublishAot=true with only RuntimeIdentifiers=linux-x64 selects packages.linux-x64.aot.lock.json.",
    "Original RuntimeIdentifier condition follows the fallback and wins whenever the singular property is present.",
    "Ordinary restore leaves the specialized path unset and continues to use the existing ordinary lock."
  ],
